    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"党建网\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Official Communist Party website publishing ideological content and articles on party principles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"桑林峰\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Author of the article discussing Communist Party principles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"董必武\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Communist leader who enforced strict principles: prohibited staff from accepting gifts or using his name for privileges, refused relatives' special requests.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"叶剑英\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Poet who wrote '怀董老' praising Dong Biwu's adherence to party principles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"周恩来\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Leader who maintained absolute secrecy (even from his wife Deng Yingchao) and upheld public-private boundaries.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"邓颖超\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Zhou Enlai's wife and Central Committee member, kept unaware of state secrets like atomic bomb development.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"黄克诚\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Official who enforced rules strictly: paid for damaged public property personally, banned private use of government vehicles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"彭德怀\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Military commander who compensated villagers with personal sugar ration for accidentally broken property during wartime.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"邓小平\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Leader who combated corruption in 1949 Chongqing by chairing committees to reclaim misused public resources.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"重庆\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"City liberated in 1949 where Deng Xiaoping addressed corruption among party members.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"太行山\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Mountain region where Peng Dehuai's troops were stationed during wartime discipline incident.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"党性原则\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Core Communist Party doctrine requiring members to prioritize collective interests over personal gain.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"三大纪律八项注意\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Military discipline code enforced by Peng Dehuai during wartime operations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"董必武\"<|>\"党性原则\"<|>\"Implemented strict personal conduct rules embodying Party principles, rejecting nepotism.\"<|>\"rule enforcement, integrity\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"叶剑英\"<|>\"董必武\"<|>\"Wrote poem specifically praising Dong Biwu's unwavering commitment to Party discipline.\"<|>\"ideological admiration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"周恩来\"<|>\"邓颖超\"<|>\"Maintained state secrets from his wife to uphold confidentiality principles despite marital relationship.\"<|>\"confidentiality, principle adherence\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"黄克诚\"<|>\"党性原则\"<|>\"Enforced rules about public property compensation and vehicle usage demonstrating absolute adherence to Party standards.\"<|>\"integrity, rule compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"彭德怀\"<|>\"三大纪律八项注意\"<|>\"Personally compensated villagers for property damage to uphold military discipline code during wartime.\"<|>\"accountability, discipline\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"邓小平\"<|>\"重庆\"<|>\"Addressed post-liberation corruption by establishing resource-reclamation committees in this city.\"<|>\"anti-corruption, governance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"党性原则\"<|>\"共产党人\"<|>\"Defined as the fundamental standard requiring Party members to prioritize collective over personal interests.\"<|>\"ideological foundation\"<|>10)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"Party discipline, integrity, anti-corruption, historical leadership, ideological adherence\")<|COMPLETE|>"
