<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity Market Risk Types: Defined categories include supply-demand imbalance, price anomalies, unfair competition, system failures, contract breaches, and other operational risks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟电厂聚合资源类型\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Virtual Power Plant Resource Types: Classifies resources as real-time controllable (direct grid interaction) or day-ahead responsive (multi-hour/day scheduling).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"规则施行\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Implementation of Rules: The rules take effect on March 1, 2026, replacing previous Shaanxi electricity trading regulations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"陕西省发展和改革委员会\"<|>\"Both organizations are jointly responsible for interpreting the electricity market rules.\"<|>\"regulatory collaboration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"规则施行\"<|>\"The Bureau co-issued and enforces the implementation of these electricity market rules.\"<|>\"policy enforcement\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"陕西省发展和改革委员会\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"The Commission oversees policy implementation within Shaanxi Province.\"<|>\"regional governance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新型经营主体\"<|>\"虚拟电厂聚合资源类型\"<|>\"Virtual power plants are categorized as a type of new business entity under the rules.\"<|>\"entity classification\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"绿色电力\"<|>\"新型经营主体\"<|>\"Distributed renewable sources (e.g., wind/solar) under green power are classified as new business entities.\"<|>\"resource categorization\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"按日连续开市\"<|>\"交易序列\"<|>\"Daily market activities organize trading sequences based on methods and cycles.\"<|>\"operational framework\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"双边协商交易\"<|>\"集中竞价交易\"<|>\"Both are distinct transaction methods defined under the market rules.\"<|>\"trading mechanisms\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"滚动撮合交易\"<|>\"挂牌交易\"<|>\"Both represent continuous/offer-based trading approaches within the market structure.\"<|>\"market operations\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulations, trading mechanisms, renewable energy, risk management, policy implementation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
