ors, users, and sellers via bilateral/centralized mechanisms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省(区、市)\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Provinces, autonomous regions, and municipalities are subject to electricity transaction supervision by local authorities.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家发展改革委\"<|>\"国家能源局\"<|>\"Collaborate in guiding/supervising electricity plan implementation and policy assessments per Chapter 1 Article 5.\"<|>\"regulatory collaboration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局\"<|>\"区域派出机构\"<|>\"Regional agencies implement national supervision of regional electricity markets per Chapter 1 Article 5.\"<|>\"administrative oversight\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Exchange grid safety data and market operation information per Chapter 2 Articles 11-12.\"<|>\"operational coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Generation enterprises must obey dispatch commands for grid stability per Chapter 2 Article 7.\"<|>\"compliance obligation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Users must follow dispatch orders during system emergencies per Chapter 2 Article 8.\"<|>\"operational compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Selling companies provide user data to trading institutions per Chapter 2 Article 9.\"<|>\"data exchange\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Grid enterprises operate under dispatch commands and assume financial liability for execution errors per Chapter 2 Article 10.\"<|>\"operational dependency\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力中长期交易\"<|>\"燃煤机组\"<|>\"Planned electricity for coal units falls under medium/long-term transaction management per Chapter 1 Article 3.\"<|>\"regulatory coverage\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity regulations, market oversight, entity obligations, trading mechanisms, grid compliance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
