ract integrity, market impact\"<|>5)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"月度发电计划\"<|>\"Responsible for executing monthly power generation plans formed from transaction results.\"<|>\"plan implementation, resource allocation\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulations, transaction mechanisms, safety compliance, contractual frameworks, grid operations\")<|COMPLETE|>"
