on before finalization.\"<|>\"regulatory requirement, process dependency\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Submit transaction data and disputes to trading institutions while following published results.\"<|>\"market participation, procedural adherence\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"偏差电量处理机制\"<|>\"Use mechanisms like electricity transfer to resolve contract deviations per market rules.\"<|>\"contract management, deviation resolution\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"跨区跨省交易\"<|>\"省内交易\"<|>\"Inter-regional transactions must integrate with provincial trading plans and balance arrangements.\"<|>\"market integration, grid management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"优先发电合同\"<|>\"年度交易\"<|>\"Priority generation contracts are signed before annual market transactions commence.\"<|>\"regulatory sequencing, market structure\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market mechanisms, transaction safety protocols, grid operations, inter-regional coordination\")<|COMPLETE|>"
