g platforms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Guaranteed Quantity and Price\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Pricing model combining fixed volumes with fixed rates in priority generation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Guaranteed Quantity with Bidding\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Pricing model where fixed electricity volumes are paired with competitive bidding rates.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Power Dispatching Agency\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Organization\"<|>\"Collaborate on security verification processes and monthly generation plan adjustments based on trading contracts.\"<|>\"regulatory coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Grid Enterprise\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Organization\"<|>\"Grid enterprises submit metering data to trading organizations for settlement, while trading organizations provide settlement documentation.\"<|>\"data exchange, settlement processing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Priority Generation Contracts\"<|>\"Base Electricity Contracts\"<|>\"Both contract types undergo monthly adjustments and share deviation settlement mechanisms through pre-listed adjustment systems.\"<|>\"contract management, deviation handling\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Deviation Electricity Settlement\"<|>\"Market-based Trading Contracts\"<|>\"Settlement mechanisms calculate imbalances using contract volumes from market-based trading as reference points.\"<|>\"performance accountability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Deviation Electricity Settlement\"<|>\"Guaranteed Quantity with Bidding\"<|>\"Deviation penalties incorporate bidding prices from the 'Guaranteed Quantity with Bidding' model during settlement calculations.\"<|>\"pricing integration\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulations, contract management, settlement processes, grid operations, deviation handling\")<|COMPLETE|>"
