ring market operations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"The Power Trading Center establishes traceability relationships based on green electricity contracts and provides traceability services.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, service provision\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Collaborate to provide explanations for transaction objections within one working day.\"<|>\"operational coordination, dispute resolution\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Grid companies provide separate electricity information for deviation settlement of residential/agricultural users and agency procurement.\"<|>\"data sharing, settlement support\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"能源监管机构\"<|>\"电力市场运营机构\"<|>\"Market operators report suspected market manipulation to energy regulators and assist investigations.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, violation reporting\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"陕西省\"<|>\"中长期市场\"<|>\"Shaanxi Province implements specific medium-to-long-term market rules including safety check exemptions during spot market operations.\"<|>\"jurisdictional regulation, market framework\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"资源聚合类新型经营主体\"<|>\"偏差电量结算\"<|>\"Aggregated resources settle separately based on contracted energy prices rather than deviation settlement rules.\"<|>\"contractual settlement, special provisions\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"Electricity Market Rules, Trading Mechanisms, Settlement Procedures, Regulatory Compliance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
