    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"省电力交易中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Responsible for publishing monthly centralized bidding transaction results and handling electronic contracts after safety checks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省发展改革委\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Receives filings for centralized bidding transactions from trading centers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北能源监管局\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regulatory body receiving transaction filings and involved in emergency transaction oversight.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"交易中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Organizes various electricity transactions, publishes results, and handles contract filings.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网调度机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Conducts safety checks for transactions, coordinates weekly trading, and executes dispatch plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Entities participating in electricity trading, subject to contract transfer restrictions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Coordinates with local power companies for cross-grid transaction execution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省地方电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Collaborates with provincial power companies on direct transaction implementation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Region referenced for resource advantages and economic development goals in electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Region covered by specific energy regulations and regulatory authorities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Mandatory safety verification process for all transactions, conducted by dispatching agencies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"周内交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-week transactions organized to address significant deviations in monthly plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Contract electricity transfer transactions to resolve execution deviations, conducted monthly.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"跨省跨区交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Cross-province/region electricity transactions coordinated with local markets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Bilateral negotiation format for electricity contract transfers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中竞价\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Centralized bidding mechanism used in monthly and weekly transactions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"挂牌交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Listing transaction method for electricity contracts.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省电力交易中心\"<|>\"省发展改革委\"<|>\"Trading center submits centralized bidding contracts to Provincial Development and Reform Commission for filing.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省电力交易中心\"<|>\"西北能源监管局\"<|>\"Trading center reports centralized bidding contracts to Northwest Energy Regulatory Bureau.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"交易中心\"<|>\"电网调度机构\"<|>\"Trading center collaborates with dispatching agencies to organize weekly transactions and conduct safety checks.\"<|>\"operational coordination\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"跨省跨区交易\"<|>\"Retail electricity companies participate in cross-province transactions with specific contract requirements.\"<|>\"market participation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"网对点交易\"<|>\"Shaanxi leverages resource advantages through point-to-grid transactions to boost economic development.\"<|>\"regional development\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"Contract electricity transfers require safety verification before execution.\"<|>\"compliance requirement\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网调度机构\"<|>\"辅助服务\"<|>\"Dispatching agencies determine demand for auxiliary services like peak regulation and reserves.\"<|>\"service management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省电力公司\"<|>\"省地方电力公司\"<|>\"Collaborate on cross-grid transaction execution and verification.\"<|>\"infrastructure coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"双边协商\"<|>\"合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"Bilateral negotiation is an approved method for conducting contract electricity transfers.\"<|>\"transaction mechanism\"<|>10)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulation, transaction mechanisms, grid safety, contract management, regional coordination\")<|COMPLETE|>"
