initions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Market entities generating electricity that require approvals/licenses, compliance with industrial/environmental standards, and registration to participate in trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity consumers meeting industrial/environmental policies, with independent meters, who may participate via retailers or directly after fulfilling obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"独立辅助服务提供商\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Entities offering grid-stabilization services (e.g., frequency regulation) after passing technical tests by dispatching organizations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"市场准入与退出\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulatory framework defining eligibility criteria, registration requirements, and procedures for entry/exit from electricity markets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力直接交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Bilateral/centralized transactions between generators and users/sellers, facilitated by grid companies providing transmission services.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Transfer of contracted electricity volumes between market entities, subject to grid safety and energy-saving policies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"跨省跨区交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Trading between Shaanxi-based entities and those in other provinces/regions, categorized as intra-Northwest or extra-Northwest transactions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"辅助服务交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Mechanism for procuring grid-stability services (frequency control, voltage regulation, etc.) from qualified providers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Transaction method involving direct negotiations between parties, followed by safety checks and official confirmation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中竞价交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Auction-based trading where entities submit bids/offers, cleared by trading organizations after safety validation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"挂牌交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Transaction method where offers are publicly listed and accepted by qualified counterp