, considering grid constraints, renewable energy absorption, and operational limits.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"交易规则\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Procedural frameworks governing contract adjustments, mutual protection mechanisms, and emergency transactions.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Collaborate on transaction safety checks: Trading Agency organizes deals, Dispatching Agency verifies grid feasibility.\"<|>\"operational coordination, regulatory compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"跨省跨区电量交易\"<|>\"Xinjiang is the regulated region for cross-provincial transactions with specific 'Power Aid Xinjiang' prioritization rules.\"<|>\"regional regulation, energy policy\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局新疆监管办公室\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"Approves minimum grid operation modes and safety check procedures for Xinjiang's electricity market.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, policy enforcement\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"预挂牌月平衡偏差交易\"<|>\"市场管理委员会\"<|>\"Market Management Committee consults on price limits for pre-listed balancing transactions requiring regulatory approval.\"<|>\"price regulation, market design\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"月度互保交易\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"Mutual protection transactions require safety checks; unverified components are canceled or adjusted post-transaction.\"<|>\"risk mitigation, compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulation, transaction mechanisms, grid safety, cross-regional trading, policy compliance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
