ted within annual limits, serving as basis for settlements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"市场交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Market Transactions encompass all electricity trading activities (bilateral, bidding, listing) governed by standardized rules and safety checks in the regional electricity market.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"The Electricity Trading Agency relies on the Power Dispatching Agency for safety checks of transaction results and receives transmission capacity/maintenance data essential for market operations.\"<|>\"regulatory coordination, safety compliance\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"月度双边协商交易\"<|>\"The Electricity Trading Agency organizes and manages the Monthly Bilateral Negotiation Transaction by setting schedules, processing agreements, and publishing results.\"<|>\"transaction management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"月度集中竞价(撮合)交易\"<|>\"The Electricity Trading Agency facilitates the Monthly Centralized Bidding Transaction by announcing details, processing bids, and coordinating safety validations.\"<|>\"auction administration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"月度挂牌交易\"<|>\"The Electricity Trading Agency oversees the Monthly Listing Transaction by setting volume limits, processing applications, and publishing safety-validated outcomes.\"<|>\"platform governance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"The Power Dispatching Agency provides region-specific transmission capacity data and maintenance schedules critical for Xinjiang's electricity market operations.\"<|>\"infrastructure management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"月度双边协商交易\"<|>\"The Monthly Bilateral Negotiation Transaction specifically addresses Xinjiang's regional electricity demands and transmission arrangements as per regulatory provisions.\"<|>\"regional market operations\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"月度集中竞价(撮合)交易\"<|>\"Xinjiang's electricity supply-demand predictions and transmission constraints direc