ervices (e.g., frequency regulation, AGC, reserves); incentivizes participation from demand-side resources and energy storage.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"计量装置\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Meters installed at property demarcation points; require primary/secondary meters with consistent specifications; primary meter data used for settlement.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Dispatch agencies execute monthly plans while trading agencies track/publish progress; trading agencies publish information when dispatch agencies provide written explanations for disputes.\"<|>\"operational coordination, plan execution\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"国家能源局新疆监管办公室\"<|>\"Dispatch agencies must submit written emergency reports to this office.\"<|>\"regulatory reporting, emergency response\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"Dispatch agencies arrange generation plans based on system needs and contract curves; determine auxiliary service demand; handle emergency dispatches affecting market entities.\"<|>\"operational control, market regulation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"Trading agencies publish plan execution progress and settlement-related information; collect metering data from entities for settlement.\"<|>\"information management, settlement processing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"合同电量偏差\"<|>\"Market entities use methods like contract transfers and mutual agreements to manage contract electricity deviations.\"<|>\"deviation management, contractual compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"预挂牌月平衡偏差交易\"<|>\"预挂牌日平衡偏差交易\"<|>\"Both are methods for handling contract electricity deviations using pre-listed units prioritized by compensation price, but operate at different time resolutions (monthly vs. daily).\"<|>\"deviation balancing, alternative mechanisms\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"辅助服务\"<|>\"Auxiliary services are being progressively marketized within the Xinjiang region based on local power market conditions.\"<|>\"regional policy, market development\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulation, contract deviation management, auxiliary services, dispatch operations, settlement procedures\")<|COMPLETE|>"
