vices included in settlements, with data provided by dispatching agencies.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"Collaborate on settlement processes; trading institutions provide transmission/distribution fee statements to grid companies.\"<|>\"settlement coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"偏差考核费用\"<|>\"Generation enterprises pay/receive deviation penalties based on contract performance beyond allowed ranges.\"<|>\"financial penalties\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"Users represented by sellers have deviations calculated bundled (±5% allowance) with settlement data submitted to trading institutions.\"<|>\"agency representation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Dispatching agencies provide deviation responsibility assessments and ancillary service data to trading institutions for settlements.\"<|>\"data provision\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局新疆监管办公室\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Trading institutions file verified deviation responsibility reports with this regulatory office.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"月结月清\"<|>\"Generation enterprises follow monthly settlement/clearing principles for priority and market contract electricity.\"<|>\"settlement cycle\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market settlements, deviation management, regulatory framework, contract enforcement\")<|COMPLETE|>"
